 *
 * 1. restore unescaped character (Text)
 * 2. merge continuous Texts
 * 3. replace whitespaces in InlineCode#value with one whitespace
 *    reference: http://spec.commonmark.org/0.25/#example-605
 * 4. split Text into Sentence
